id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gruntmoon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gruntmoon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gruntmoon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gruntmoon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gruntmoon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gruntmoon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-29T02:47:13Z","updated_at":"2025-07-29T02:47:13Z","body":"No worries I misunderstand. Then I cant really share anything because the project is rather large with a lot of resources imported already. It would take some time to cleanup all the references and resources. 😅 \n\nI thought there is some specific settings I can alter to test results.\n\nSorry about it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3130402408/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3677551241","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108957#issuecomment-3677551241","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108957","id":3677551241,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bMvqJ","user":{"login":"zommerfelds","id":1260622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjA2MjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1260622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zommerfelds","html_url":"https://github.com/zommerfelds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zommerfelds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zommerfelds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zommerfelds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zommerfelds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zommerfelds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zommerfelds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zommerfelds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zommerfelds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zommerfelds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-20T07:54:56Z","updated_at":"2025-12-20T07:56:40Z","body":"I ran into this issue today as well when running in headless mode (` godot -e --headless --quit`).\n\n`4.5.1.stable.official.f62fdbde1` on Windows\n\nI have a tool script that reads and recomputes a mesh (takes ~50ms to execute). Workarounds for me are:\n\n* Run with `godot -e --headless --quit-after 1`\n* Remove the @tool annotation\n* Skip the tool code when in headless:\n```\nfunc _ready():\n\tif DisplayServer.get_name() == \"headless\" and Engine.is_editor_hint():\n\t\treturn\n```\n\nThe tool script is roughly like this:\n\n```\nfunc _ready():\n\tif DisplayServer.get_name() == \"headless\" and Engine.is_editor_hint():\n\t\tprint(\"world_blocks: skipping mesh processing in headless editor\")\n\t\treturn\n\tvisible = false # Hide the original mesh\n\t# Need to await CSGShape processing (https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_csgshape3d.html)\n\tawait get_tree().process_frame\n\t\n\tvar meshes = get_meshes()\n\tvar mesh_transform = meshes[0] as Transform3D\n\tvar source_mesh = meshes[1] as Mesh\n\t\n\tvar colored_mesh = create_mesh_with_vertex_shading_data(source_mesh)\n\t\n\tvar mesh_instance = MeshInstance3D.new()\n\tmesh_instance.transform = mesh_transform\n\tmesh_instance.mesh = colored_mesh\n\tmesh_instance.material_override = material_override\n\tget_parent().add_child(mesh_instance)\n\tloading_ready.emit()\n....\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3677551241/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3879768434","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108957#issuecomment-3879768434","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108957","id":3879768434,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nQJFy","user":{"login":"DarioDaF","id":10617344,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjE3MzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10617344?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioDaF","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioDaF","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioDaF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioDaF/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioDaF/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioDaF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioDaF/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioDaF/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioDaF/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioDaF/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioDaF/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-10T17:47:00Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T17:47:00Z","body":"Similar probably related issue opening a project with forward plus:\n\nERROR: Pages in use exist at exit in PagedAllocator: N33RendererSceneRenderImplementation22RenderForwardClustered32GeometryInstanceSurfaceDataCacheE\n   at: ~PagedAllocator (./core/templates/paged_allocator.h:169)\nERROR: Pages in use exist at exit in PagedAllocator: N33RendererSceneRenderImplementation22RenderForwardClustered32GeometryInstanceForwardClusteredE\n   at: ~PagedAllocator (./core/templates/paged_allocator.h:169)\nERROR: 1 shaders of type SceneForwardClusteredShaderRD were never freed\n   at: ~ShaderRD (servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shader_rd.cpp:1056)\nGodot Engine v4.6.stable.official.89cea1439 - https://godotengine.org\nD3D12 12_0 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU\n\nThere is some script generated geometries (only gdscriprt stuff, no plugins no mono) in the project, but I can't share the project as is, on latest godot as shown above","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3879768434/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3879828714","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108957#issuecomment-3879828714","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108957","id":3879828714,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nQXzq","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-10T17:59:25Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T18:01:09Z","body":"I found the same issue on the GDExtension side. I determined that I had a call to `variant_construct` that was passed an already initialized `Variant` reference, which led to the leaks.  The API explicitly expected an uninitialized `Variant` reference, and so an explicit `clear` was required before making the call.\n\nPerhaps there is another use case on the engine side where a call expects an uninitialized Variant reference, but what is being provided is an uncleared, already populated Variant reference to another type?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3879828714/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5618319677","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108957#issuecomment-5618319677","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108957","id":5618319677,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTuDBPQ","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.c